WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.257 --> 00:00:02.739
GEMMA CHAN
The Eternals is definitely

00:00:02.789 --> 00:00:04.480
a very ambitious film.

00:00:05.125 --> 00:00:06.548
SERSI
It's beautiful, isn't it?

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.466
GEMMA CHAN
You've got 10 new characters.

00:00:08.516 --> 00:00:12.528
It spans 7,000 years.
The scope and the scale of it is huge.

00:00:15.836 --> 00:00:17.906
CHLOE ZHAO
What excites me the most

00:00:17.957 --> 00:00:21.335
is the world building, and the design.

00:00:21.844 --> 00:00:24.727
Jack Kirby's comics
are great inspirations.

00:00:27.641 --> 00:00:29.505
KEVIN FEIGE
What we really wanted to do was

00:00:29.555 --> 00:00:34.442
start fresh with whole new characters,
new storylines, but actually go back

00:00:34.492 --> 00:00:38.219
to some of the deepest, 
richest mythology in all of Marvel comics.

00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:41.291
CHLOE ZHAO
Each of my cast come from different

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:43.675
backgrounds and they come
from different life experiences.

00:00:45.446 --> 00:00:49.662
So I'm trying to see how much of
this character is already in this person.

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:55.005
NATE MOORE
Chloe Zhao really pressed us to shoot more

00:00:55.056 --> 00:00:58.432
of this on practical locations,
which is challenging, but it's all

00:00:58.482 --> 00:01:00.356
in service of an aesthetic
that's totally different.

00:01:01.254 --> 00:01:03.028
IKARIS
You hear that? Eternals assemble.

00:01:03.826 --> 00:01:05.304
KEVIN FEIGE
The impact that Eternals will have

00:01:05.355 --> 00:01:06.400
on the MCU...

00:01:07.974 --> 00:01:12.210
...will be nothing less than
redefining the cinematic universe entirely.

